  "notes": "The case verifies a single active, non-regional object-class subscription composed of two adapter-selected attributes. Following the standard attribute-set unsubscribe service for one attribute, a fresh standard MIM subscription query must still report the object class and report only the remaining attribute, preserving the active flag and update-rate designator. This is limited to ordinary attribute subscription and MOM query/report behavior; it makes no claim about DDM, region-associated subscriptions, the full subscription service surface, or provider conformance.",
